rital status, veteran status or any other classification protected by applicable law. Applicants requiring reasonable accommodation to access job listings or the application process, please contact Human Resources . Printer-friendly Info for Future Students Current Students Alumni Community Members Faculty & Staff FOLLOW DETROIT MERCY UDM Facebook UDM Twitter UDM YouTube UDM Instagram UDM TikTok UDM LinkedIn University of Detroit Mercy, a Catholic university in the Jesuit and Mercy traditions 4001 W. McNichols Road Detroit, Michigan 48221-3038 CAMPUSES • CONTACT UDM Athletics Mission Public Safety Web Privacy & Policy Consumer Disclosure Careers at UDM Back to Top"
